  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>How staging.operation maps to nds.station:

1) DELETE - Soft-delete the current active row: set row_status=deleted, is_current=false, and effective_to=now. Keep history. Do not hard-delete.

2) INSERT or UPDATE when an active row already exists - Update that same row in place (name, lat/lon, capacity, station_status, loaded_at). Do not open a new SCD version.

3) INSERT or UPDATE when no active row exists (first load or reactivation the station after DELETE) - Insert a new active row with effective_from=now, effective_to=null, is_current=true.

Lookup / update keys always target the current active row (is_current=true), never a closed history row.</note>
